    {
      "id": "operator-dns-resolution-resolution-workflow-lesson",
      "slug": "resolution-workflow",
      "title": "Resolution troubleshooting workflow",
      "type": "theory",
      "order": 7,
      "category": "networking",
      "concept": "dns_workflow",
      "version": 1,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "text": "Resolution troubleshooting workflow"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "Проверяйте точное имя, `getent`, hosts/NSS config, затем route и listener. Не смешивайте DNS failure с HTTP status."
        },
        {
          "type": "code",
          "language": "bash",
          "code": "getent hosts localhost; ip route"
        },
        {
          "type": "bullets",
          "items": [
            "Цель: Сравните resolution имени и локальный route state.",
            "Проверка: Resolution предшествует transport connection и HTTP exchange."
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "note",
          "tone": "warning",
          "text": "Resolution предшествует transport connection и HTTP exchange."
        }
      ],
      "completion": {
        "explicitContinue": true
      }
    },
